# KMP / Compose

- Shared UI/logic in `commonMain`; platform code via `expect`/`actual`.
- Room only in `nonWebMain` (+ android/ios builders). Never add Room to js/wasm.
- DI: register new repos/VMs in `di/AppModule.kt`.
- Nav: typed `AppRoute` + polymorphic serializers in `AppNavGraph`.
- UI: Material 3 + `PansariTheme`; responsive via `AdaptivePane` / width class.
- Keep ViewModels thin: state in `StateFlow`, side effects via events/jobs.
- Prefer existing designsystem helpers over new card/layout systems.
